  "label": "Weapon as Symbol of Power",
  "description": "The handgun in the image is not just a firearm but a symbolic representation of power, aggression, and the potential for violence. In popular culture and media, weapons are often used to convey dominance, threat, or retaliation. The visual of the gun amplifies the hostile message in the text, making the threat more visceral and impactful.",
